// Rule: [T1102.003] Canto Incognito Poellm - Poellm Github Poem C2 Discovery
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1102.003
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceNetworkEvents
// Purpose: Hunts GitHub poem-based C2 discovery from compromised AI infrastructure.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceNetworkEvents for poellm github poem c2 discovery using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceNetworkEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: Absence of results therefore does not prove absence of PoeLLM or the GitHub fetch.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Canto Incognito / PoeLLM - GitHub poem-based C2 discovery
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1102.003 - Web Service: One-Way Communication
// Platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Status: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Required telemetry: Microsoft Defender for Endpoint DeviceNetworkEvents
// Evidence: Black Lotus Labs observed PoeLLM retrieving a file named dash.css
// from a GitHub repository owned by ejejejdfbbebe to derive the current C2 IP.
// Limitation: RemoteUrl may contain only an FQDN in some events. Absence of
// results therefore does not prove absence of PoeLLM or the GitHub fetch.

DeviceNetworkEvents
| where RemoteUrl has "ejejejdfbbebe"
| where RemoteUrl endswith "dash.css"
| project
    Timestamp,
    DeviceName,
    RemoteUrl,
    RemoteIP,
    RemotePort,
    Protocol,
    InitiatingProcessFileName,
    InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
    InitiatingProcessFolderPath,
    InitiatingProcessSHA1,
    InitiatingProcessAccountName,
    ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
